<Base title="Privacy" description="How Modern Software handles project enquiries and information submitted through this website."><article class="prose wrap"><span class="eyebrow">PRIVACY</span><h1>Your information.</h1><p>When you submit an enquiry, Modern Software uses your name, contact information and project details to respond, discuss requirements and manage any resulting business relationship.</p><h2>Where your enquiry goes</h2><p>Enquiries are delivered by SendGrid to Glen’s business-managed email inbox. When lead storage is enabled, enquiry details and campaign source information supplied with the form are also stored in a private Firebase database so Glen can manage follow-ups. The website is hosted on Vercel. These providers process information needed to operate the service and may process it outside the UK under their applicable terms and safeguards.</p><h2>What to share</h2><p>Provide only what is needed to explain your enquiry. Do not submit passwords, financial account details or confidential information about customers.</p><h2>Keeping information</h2><p>Enquiry correspondence is kept while needed to respond, manage the relationship and meet applicable record-keeping obligations. Enquiry contacts are not added to a marketing list automatically.</p><h2>Website storage</h2><p>With your permission, public marketing pages load a Google Ads tag to measure advertising visits and successful project enquiries. Google receives advertising identifiers and technical information such as your browser, page address and IP address; we do not send your name, email, phone or project message to Google Ads. The tag is blocked until you accept optional measurement cookies. Rejecting them does not affect the enquiry form. You can change your choice using Cookie preferences in the footer; withdrawing consent stops future measurement. Cookies previously stored can be removed through your browser settings. We store your cookie choice in your browser. Google may process measurement information outside the UK under its applicable safeguards. Private administration tools use Firebase authentication and related browser storage to manage signed-in access.</p><h2>Questions and requests</h2><p>For questions, access, correction or deletion requests, email <a href="mailto:glen.adamson@modern-software.co.uk">glen.adamson@modern-software.co.uk</a>. You can also raise a concern with the <a href="https://ico.org.uk/make-a-complaint/">Information Commissioner’s Office</a>.</p></article></Base>
